" I use Amazon's VAT Calculation Service, so the tax amounts in my report are the ones Amazon charged. "
"Not using the VAT Calculation Service?"
"Without it, your order report does not carry the tax amounts Amazon charged, and we would have to guess them. We never guess tax amounts, so issuing stays off until this box is ticked."
"What you can do: switch the VAT Calculation Service on in your Seller Central tax settings so future reports include the amounts, or ask your gestor how they want the VAT shown. If this blocks you, tell us on the contact page - it decides what we build next."
